
No Player Selected Tests:
Test 1 - Click off board:
    Action: Click on coordinates outside of the boards boundary
    Expected:
        No tiles highlighted
        No player state changed
        No errors logged

Test 2 - Click on tile without player:
    Action: Click on any board tile with no player on it
    Expected:
        No tiles highlighted
        No player state changed
        No errors logged

Player Selection Tests:
Test 3 - Player selection:
    Action: Click on tile the player is on
    Expected:
        Random number generated (1-6)
        BFS highlights only tiles within that distance.
        BFS doesn't ignore any walls
        Game waits for new user input

Test 4 - Valid Role:
    Action: After Player Selected
    Expected:
        Role should be between 1-6
        Role should have an even distribution of results
        Role should be used when getting the tiles the player can move to

Test 5 - Valid Highlighted Tiles:
    Action: After Player Selected
    Expected:
        Stops at rolled distance
        Does not pass through any tile's walls
        Tile player is standing on should be highlighted

Movement Tests:
Test 6 - Invalid Tile Clicked:
    Action: Click on not highlighted tile (player can't move there)
    Expected:
        The same tiles highlighted
        Game continues to wait for user input
        No errors logged

Test 8 - Click on Valid Tile:
    Action: Click on a highlighted tile (Player can move there)
    Expected:
        Player is moved to selected tile
        Highlights are removed
